{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"cmd":"init","ctl":"service","desc":"Initializes the Newbound backend, launching a comprehensive web server that handles incoming HTTP requests, manages user sessions, and facilitates real-time communication via WebSockets. Sessions come from the session_id query parameter, the sessionid cookie, or - only when config.properties has basicauth=true - an HTTP Basic Authorization header checked against the security users on every request (one reused session per user, kept in system.basic_sessions; valid Basic credentials override an anonymous or foreign cookie session). A command that declares an nn_method parameter is a protocol adapter: when it is denied, the listener answers 401 with WWW-Authenticate: Basic (Basic enabled and nobody logged in, or wrong credentials) or 403 (logged in but not in the command's groups; also every denial when Basic is off) instead of the JSON UNAUTHORIZED error in a 200 that ordinary commands keep.","import":"use std::thread;\nuse std::panic;\nuse std::fs;\nuse flowlang::datastore::*;\nuse std::net::TcpListener;\nuse flowlang::appserver::save_config;\nuse flowlang::appserver::fire_event;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::unique_session_id::unique_session_id;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::time::time;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::http::hex_decode::hex_decode;\nuse std::net::TcpStream;\nuse std::sync::Once;\n// Removed: use state::Storage;\n// Removed: use std::sync::RwLock;\nuse ndata::sharedmutex::GlobalSharedMutex; // Added for GlobalSharedMutex\nuse ndata::heap::Heap;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::file::mime_type::mime_type;\nuse flowlang::rfc2822date::RFC2822Date;\nuse std::path::Path;\nuse std::fs::metadata;\nuse flowlang::sha1::SHA1;\nuse flowlang::base64::Base64;\nuse flowlang::appserver::lookup_command_id;\nuse flowlang::command::Command;\nuse flowlang::appserver::add_event_hook;\nuse std::io::Write;\nuse std::io::Read;\nuse core::time::Duration;\nuse crate::peer::service::exec::exec;\nuse crate::securi